        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Peter Chelsom, Billy Bob Thornton, Peter Flannery, Simon Fields, Lewis\n- Works: Funny Bones, Max Rose\n- Roles: film director, writer, actor, filmmaker, singer, songwriter, musician, producer\n\nFacts:\n- Billy Bob Thornton was born on August 4, 1955, and he is an American actor, filmmaker, singer, songwriter, and musician.\n- Peter Chelsom was born on April 20, 1956, and he is a British film director, writer, and actor.\n- Funny Bones was written, directed, and produced by Peter Chelsom.\n- Funny Bones was co-produced by Simon Fields and co-written by Peter Flannery.\n- Max Rose was Lewis' first starring film role since 1995's Funny Bones, and it was also his final starring role.",
